OL,3,GNEWSACopycat police car seized being
OL,4,Adriven illegally
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car some might have thought was a
OL,7,Fpolice car with distinctive Battenburg
OL,8,Fmarkings along its side was seized by
OL,9,Fofficers because it was being driven
OL,10,Fillegally.
OL,12,FThames Valley Police (TVP) said it was
OL,13,Fstopped on the A33 in Reading,
OL,14,FBerkshire, and that the driver had no
OL,15,Finsurance and had not paid tax on the
OL,16,Fvehicle.
OL,18,FIt had missing wheel nuts on both of
OL,19,Fits rear wheels and had no valid MOT.
OL,20,FThe car was taken away on the back of a
OL,21,Frecovery truck.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
