OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog being carried in the car ` which
OL,7,Fhad "dog section" written down its side
OL,8,F` spent a night "somewhere a little
OL,9,Fsafer", while the car's owner arranged
OL,10,Fa lift home, TVP said.
